Action: weights_inverse_error  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool_full","shrinkage":0.5,"per_horizon":false}

Thought: test a per‑horizon best‑model weighting to exploit possible horizon‑specific winners in this highly seasonal, unstable‑ranking series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"best_per_horizon"}

Thought: The ranking is unstable and several correlated groups exist; a subset of the most stable models might reduce noise.  
Action: select_stable  
Action Input: {"k":5,"metric":"rmse"}

Thought: Try a weighted inverse_error on the stable 5‑model pool (ETS, THETA, NaiveMovingAverage, ARIMA, catboost) to see if a focused subset improves over full‑pool weighted best‑per‑horizon.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error","rationale":"focus on stable, low‑error subset"}

