Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the stable pool1 to see if averaging fewer correlated models improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

